{"unit_id":"XiaoyuYoung__neko-wander#feature-1","repo":"XiaoyuYoung/neko-wander","commit":"58b8f75d35443a6261627df862c140f967937a09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"溜达喵的功能「地点搜索」：按关键词和可选城市或当前位置查找候选地点，并在地图上显示图钉。调用搜索工具触发，返回地点名称、地址和坐标。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:66","src/map-service.ts:287"]}
